    "supported": "Exact Fisher natural gradient removed the severe truth-scale sensitivity of unpreconditioned gradient descent and succeeded in every tested scenario.",
    "attacking": "A generic adaptive Hessian-diagonal preconditioner and exact-Hessian trust-region method also succeeded in every scenario. The Jacobi preconditioner used fewer function evaluations than natural gradient in 64.6% of matched cases, and trust-exact did so in 65.0%.",
